{"abstract":"The workplace is getting increasingly globalized, virtualized and networked. At the same time, work itself has become discrete, autonomous and complex. In a fast changing world, the individual knowledge worker and his interactions becomes the new locus of value creation. Management promote – not dictate - lateral technologies to enable interaction among peers – the core of knowledge creation. To target productive behavior the knowledge professional appropriate these technologies building individualized IT-knowledge artefacts. This practice leads to several dilemmas in enterprisewide knowledge work. We see a possible way forward for improving workplace practices with IT-knowledge artefact based applications, by combining new insight of how different personality traits prefer different knowledge sharing processes with new insight on personalizing persuasive technology. We explore new research and argument for further research in an attempt to solve the dilemmas in the networked enterprise.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Fischer, Louise Harder","Pries-Heje, Lene"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-383029"],"event":{"acronym":"PERSUASIVE","end":"2016-04-07","place":"Salzburg, at","start":"2016-04-05","title":"11th International Conference on Persuasive Technology","year":"2016"},"filters":{"added":"2024-06","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Globalization","IT knowledge Artefacts","Knowledge work","Lateral Technologies","Personality traits"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"persuasiveness personalization amp productive workplace practices with it knowledge artefacts","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://ceur-ws.org/Vol-1582/4HarderFischer.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-383029","identifier":[{"id":"84977551047","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["itu-77853727-214a-48be-9993-9166b776f2d9"],"keyword":["Globalization","IT-Knowledge Artefacts","Knowledge Work","Lateral Technologies","Personality Traits"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-948317B6EA155B53BB20E05CF96269D5"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.itu.dk/ws/files/81843628/4HarderFischer.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://ceur-ws.org/Vol-1582/4HarderFischer.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2016","yearSub":"2016"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Business IT","The Department, Information Management"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Louise Harder","key":"fischerpau","last":"Fischer","locid":"a22e85da-82e3-410d-8ef1-31407362ba19","name":"Fischer, Louise Harder","orcid":"0000-0001-7193-3797","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Lene","key":"prieshejepau","last":"Pries-Heje","name":"Pries-Heje, Lene","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"issn":["16130073"],"journal":"CEUR Workshop Proceedings","pages":"114-119","publisher":"CEUR Workshop Proceedings","status":"p","title":"CEUR Workshop Proceedings","volume":"1582"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["itu-77853727-214a-48be-9993-9166b776f2d9"],"src":["ITU IT University of Copenhagen"],"t